WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.423 --> 00:00:04.655
(upbeat music)

00:00:04.655 --> 00:00:06.760
- It's in our genes.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.366
It's in our blood.

00:00:08.366 --> 00:00:11.174
Everything that's needed
in rugby is sort of

00:00:11.174 --> 00:00:14.507
incorporated in a Fijian when he's born.

00:00:15.572 --> 00:00:18.057
People still can't
believe that Fijians are

00:00:18.057 --> 00:00:20.390
really, really good at rugby.

00:00:22.661 --> 00:00:25.244
(upbeat music)

00:00:38.712 --> 00:00:41.129
- My name is David Dakuitoga,

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:46.382
and I'm the founder of Yamacia Rugby Club.

00:00:46.382 --> 00:00:50.099
Yamacia rugby is an initiative
to give a second chance

00:00:50.099 --> 00:00:52.013
to unemployed youths,

00:00:52.013 --> 00:00:56.180
and minimize the drug use
around the province of Namosi.

00:00:57.257 --> 00:01:00.217
Rugby would be one thing that
will take their mind away

00:01:00.217 --> 00:01:01.539
from doing all those things,

00:01:01.539 --> 00:01:05.706
and get them to do something
positive in their lives.

00:01:06.746 --> 00:01:09.110
We have limited resources.

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.443
We train using what we have.

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.707
We use logs,

00:01:13.707 --> 00:01:14.948
we use tires,

00:01:14.948 --> 00:01:18.031
we use anything and everything.

00:01:18.031 --> 00:01:22.111
What we do makes us
stronger and sort of tougher

00:01:22.111 --> 00:01:26.046
because guys get to work
even harder than the guys

00:01:26.046 --> 00:01:28.463
with those modern resources.

00:01:32.048 --> 00:01:34.945
What we are trying to
achieve is to get boys into

00:01:34.945 --> 00:01:37.028
the wider world of rugby.

00:01:41.583 --> 00:01:44.474
We've played tournaments in Fiji, Samoa,

00:01:44.474 --> 00:01:47.891
Australia, and Paris, and Europe as well.

00:01:49.702 --> 00:01:53.292
When one of my club members get a contract

00:01:53.292 --> 00:01:54.586
and play in a tournament,

00:01:54.586 --> 00:01:57.503
my whole body it's just so excited.

00:01:58.491 --> 00:02:00.362
My heart it's just full of joy.

00:02:00.362 --> 00:02:02.491
Oh, my goodness, it's just so good,

00:02:02.491 --> 00:02:03.658
feels so good.

00:02:06.706 --> 00:02:09.699
Rugby has changed my life in a way that

00:02:09.699 --> 00:02:13.866
now I'm able to provide
opportunities to other people.

00:02:15.783 --> 00:02:18.478
I can give back to Fiji as a whole.

00:02:18.478 --> 00:02:20.728
So, rugby is a life changer.

